# DiskLordz content platform (scoped)

Universal workflow is **DPCS** ([dpcs.mdc](dpcs.mdc), [DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md](../docs/DPCS_BUILD_METHODOLOGY.md)).

When editing ROM Factory or ROMpler **content**:

- Do **not** implement ROMPLER in `Wave909/`.
- Follow [CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md](../DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_ROADMAP.md); update [CONTENT_PLATFORM_PHASE0_AUDIT.md](../DisklordzSynth/Docs/CONTENT_PLATFORM_PHASE0_AUDIT.md) on Discover when the landscape changed.
- Entity chain: sample assets → multisample → tone → patch → preset (IDs, not filenames).
